{"hero":"<div style=\"font-family:'Perplexity Sans','Pretendard',Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--card-fg);height:100%;min-height:0;display:grid;grid-template-rows:38px minmax(0,1fr) 50px;overflow:hidden;\">\n  <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--card-border);padding:0 13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;fill:none;stroke:var(--card-accent);stroke-width:1.45;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-linejoin:miter;flex:none;\"><path d=\"M12 3v18M3 8h18M6 3l6 5 6-5v18l-6-5-6 5V3Z\"/><path d=\"m3 8 9 8 9-8M3 8v8l9-8 9 8V8\"/></svg>\n    <strong style=\"font-family:'Perplexity Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;\">perplexity</strong>\n    <span style=\"margin-left:auto;width:22px;height:22px;border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:9px;color:var(--card-fg-muted);\">JS</span>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding:11px 13px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;min-height:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n    <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;max-width:88%;background:var(--card-surface);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:10px 10px 3px 10px;padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.35;\">좋은 디자인 시스템의 조건은?</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--card-border);height:25px;font-size:9px;color:var(--card-fg-muted);\">\n      <span style=\"height:25px;display:flex;align-items:center;color:var(--card-fg);font-weight:650;border-bottom:2px solid var(--card-accent);\">Answer</span>\n      <span>Links</span><span>Images</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:8px;color:var(--card-fg-muted);\">\n      <span style=\"color:var(--card-accent);font-weight:700;\">✦ Pro Search</span><span>·</span><span>8 sources</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Perplexity Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;\">일관성을 만드는 세 가지 원칙</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--card-fg);\">\n      좋은 시스템은 명확한 토큰과 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트, 검증 가능한 가이드를 하나의 언어로 묶습니다<sup style=\"background:var(--card-accent);color:#0B2025;padding:0 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:7px;font-weight:800;margin-left:2px;\">1</sup>.\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px;margin-top:1px;\">\n      <div style=\"background:var(--card-surface);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:7px;padding:6px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:var(--card-fg-muted);\">1 · Tokens</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:650;margin-top:3px;\">하나의 기준</div></div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--card-surface);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:7px;padding:6px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:var(--card-fg-muted);\">2 · UI</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:650;margin-top:3px;\">빠른 재사용</div></div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--card-surface);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:7px;padding:6px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:var(--card-fg-muted);\">3 · Docs</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:650;margin-top:3px;\">명확한 근거</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding:5px 12px 9px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,var(--card-bg) 28%);\">\n    <div style=\"height:36px;background:var(--card-surface);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:12px;padding:0 8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(11,32,37,.08);\">\n      <span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:6px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--card-fg-muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1;\">+</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:9px;color:var(--card-fg-muted);\">Ask a follow-up</span>\n      <span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:8px;color:var(--card-fg-muted);\">Best</span>\n      <span style=\"width:21px;height:21px;background:var(--card-accent);color:#0B2025;border-radius:6px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;\">↑</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n</div>","card_tokens":{"light":{"bg":"#F3F3EE","surface":"#FFFFFF","border":"#D9DAD3","fg":"#13343B","fg_muted":"#5C6F73","accent":"#1FB8CD"},"dark":{"bg":"#13343B","surface":"#183F47","border":"#28545C","fg":"#F3F3EE","fg_muted":"#A9C1C5","accent":"#1FB8CD"}}}